# Guide

Unity Test is a unit testing framework built for C, with a focus on working with embedded toolchains.

Ultrasonic_Radar/
├── Ultrasonic_Radar/
│   ├── test/
│   │   └── test_hardware/
│   │       └── Uses Unity and Atmel Board
│   │   └── test_logic/
│   │       └── Uses Gtest and PC Only

## Commands for Hardware Testing

```code
pio run -t clean
pio test -e uno -vvv
```

## Commands for Logic Testing

```code
pio run -t clean
pio test -e native -vvv
```

## References

[PlatformIO Unity](https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/frameworks/unity.html)
